{"4751080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reflections at Frostkorn", "steam_appid": 4751080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the early morning he comes of age, Yu begins the sacred journey to the foothill of Mountain Frostkorn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There lies the still pond where, according to family tradition, every child must first fill their sack with tales on the journey, then empty them on the pond, and leave their childhood innocence behind, permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by his grandfather Hu, Yu walks a winding path scattered with lost tales… fragments of memory, triumph, regret, and longing that shape the person he will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet Hu carries a silence of his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.poster.avif?t=1781665183\" width=634 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.webm?t=1781665183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.mp4?t=1781665183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly crafted narrative experience lasting approximately 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich dialogue sequences weave together myth, memory, and personal reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interaction serves the journey, not the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive art direction inspired by painterly landscapes and dreamlike memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly layered soundscape of music, ambience, and fully voiced performances.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the early morning he comes of age, Yu begins the sacred journey to the foothill of Mountain Frostkorn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There lies the still pond where, according to family tradition, every child must first fill their sack with tales on the journey, then empty them on the pond, and leave their childhood innocence behind, permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by his grandfather Hu, Yu walks a winding path scattered with lost tales… fragments of memory, triumph, regret, and longing that shape the person he will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet Hu carries a silence of his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.poster.avif?t=1781665183\" width=634 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.webm?t=1781665183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751080/extras/fe1412191f05c2cdfb9ed3c229704a8b.mp4?t=1781665183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly crafted narrative experience lasting approximately 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich dialogue sequences weave together myth, memory, and personal reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interaction serves the journey, not the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive art direction inspired by painterly landscapes and dreamlike memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly layered soundscape of music, ambience, and fully voiced performances.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "On the ear